@startuml
title 成功审计同事务与失败安全事件分流
actor 调用方
participant "D事务用例" as D
participant "AuditWriter代理" as Writer
participant "AuditFunctions" as Pure
database "业务与审计数据库" as DB
participant "SecurityEventRecorder" as Recorder
participant "SecurityEventStore代理" as Store
调用方 -> D : 变更业务
D -> DB : BEGIN / 写关联与版本
D -> Writer : appendInCurrentTransaction(change)
Writer -> Pure : redactSnapshot / 规范化
alt 审计成功
  Writer -> DB : INSERT iam_audit_log (同连接)
  Writer --> D : 完成
  D -> DB : COMMIT 业务与审计
else 审计失败或快照无效
  Writer --> D : 抛异常，事务标记rollback-only
  D -> DB : ROLLBACK 业务、版本与审计
end
调用方 -> Recorder : recordSecurityEvent(拒绝事件)
Recorder -> Store : appendInNewTransaction
Store -> DB : REQUIRES_NEW / INSERT iam_login_log
alt 独立记录成功
  Store -> DB : COMMIT
  Recorder --> 调用方 : true (不受外层回滚影响)
else 独立记录失败
  Store -> DB : ROLLBACK
  Recorder --> 调用方 : false / 固定告警，仍保持拒绝
end
@enduml
